   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">We have backed Ecom Express since 2019, committing $59 million in total over 2019-2022. Our investment has helped Ecom expand new business initiatives, directly supporting the creation of 33,000 jobs by 2025. Our investment also helps maintain the company&apos;s focus on hiring women, especially in middle management, and supports road safety measures and the introduction of an electric vehicle delivery fleet.</narrative>
